1
00:00:01,401 --> 00:00:02,702
I can do it myself.

2
00:00:02,969 --> 00:00:04,871
You already wasted one
because you put it wrong.

3
00:00:11,111 --> 00:00:12,111
It's kind of unexpected.

4
00:00:12,345 --> 00:00:13,646
What is?

5
00:00:13,646 --> 00:00:15,115
You like these characters?

6
00:00:15,348 --> 00:00:16,783
My sibling likes it.

7
00:00:17,117 --> 00:00:18,451
My sibling gets hurt often.

8
00:00:19,452 --> 00:00:20,754
With that

9
00:00:20,754 --> 00:00:23,189
Eun-ho began to tell me
about his personal life.

10
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:26,993
He took his sibling and
escaped his abusive family.

11
00:00:27,193 --> 00:00:30,196
He worked multiple jobs to
afford living and his tuition.

12
00:00:30,764 --> 00:00:32,399
And all of
the hard-earned money was

13
00:00:32,399 --> 00:00:35,235
taken by the loan shark who
was looking for his father.

14
00:00:36,403 --> 00:00:38,203
That's why I always
feel grateful towards you.

15
00:00:40,073 --> 00:00:43,076
You saved me with
the advance paycheck.

16
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:45,345
That was nothing.

17
00:00:45,345 --> 00:00:46,913
After I listened to his
entire story

18
00:00:46,913 --> 00:00:47,913
I felt embarrassed.

19
00:00:48,248 --> 00:00:49,616
Can I call you by your name?

20
00:00:50,016 --> 00:00:51,785
Of course!

21
00:00:51,785 --> 00:00:52,919
From now on, call me Yijun.

22
00:00:52,919 --> 00:00:53,919
Thank you.

23
00:00:56,890 --> 00:00:59,092
So you come here every day
after your night job?

24
00:00:59,626 --> 00:01:01,294
No, I take some
rest at home...

25
00:01:02,896 --> 00:01:03,896
I'm sorry.

26
00:01:03,930 --> 00:01:05,732
No, it's okay.

27
00:01:06,466 --> 00:01:08,568
Do you want to take
a nap for a while?

28
00:01:09,069 --> 00:01:09,602
What?

29
00:01:09,769 --> 00:01:12,072
If you're tired
you can take a nap.

30
00:01:12,072 --> 00:01:13,552
We don't have
customers today, anyway.

31
00:01:14,140 --> 00:01:15,260
Just for ten minutes then...

32
00:01:16,076 --> 00:01:17,076
Good.

33
00:01:28,488 --> 00:01:29,488
Yijun?
